<title>UK: UK reserves fall underlying $98.0 mln in November.</title>
<headline>UK reserves fall underlying $98.0 mln in November.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's gold and currency reserves fell an underlying $98.0 million in November, the Treasury said. (IN MLN DOLLARS EXCEPT WHERE STATED)</p>
<p>					 November	    October</p>
<p> Underlying reserves	    - 98.0		  + 7.0</p>
<p> Actual reserves		  - 116.0		+ 2,610</p>
<p> Total actual reserves     46.57 billion	 46.69 billion</p>
</text>
